# Keep only the final, reproducible live check result in Git
검수자료/*
!검수자료/실제_API_검수.json
!검수자료/챗봇_API_검수.json

# Local legacy document outputs and one-off document generation tools
/docs/이전자료/*.docx
/docs/참고자료/*.docx
/scripts/document_tools/

# Office lock files and local test caches
~$*
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Machine-local model-server process metadata (no model/runtime binaries in Git)
.local_llm/

# Publishing hygiene: keep source, fixtures and selected final evidence
